# Local Grove state, but NOT the registry lockfile: `.grove/registry.lock.json`
# is the install-time snapshot `grove update` diffs against — a committed
# artifact, like a package lock. Ignoring it left this project unable to run
# `grove update` at all (exit 1, "no lockfile").
.grove/*
!.grove/registry.lock.json